/**
 * CuteTeachy design tokens – single source of truth.
 *
 * Derived from the "Serene Educator" design system (Google Stitch project
 * "Pastel Teacher Planner"). Consumed by:
 *  - apps/mobile → `src/theme` maps these to React Native styles
 *  - apps/web    → `css/theme.css` (generated by `pnpm --filter @cute-teachy/tokens generate`)
 *
 * IMPORTANT: this file must stay dependency-free and use only erasable TS
 * syntax (no enums / namespaces) so the CSS generator can run it with Node.
 */

